WEBVTT

00:08:58.784 --> 00:09:01.203
So I challenge you

00:09:01.245 --> 00:09:02.955
to create the change we need

00:09:02.997 --> 00:09:06.083
by incorporating equity
and lived experience

00:09:06.125 --> 00:09:09.211
into all public and government policies.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.424
My vision is to redress
the legacy of pollution

00:09:13.424 --> 00:09:15.634
by targeting frontline communities,

00:09:15.676 --> 00:09:19.555
not for pollution,
but to become green zones.

00:09:19.597 --> 00:09:25.394
Green zones where we can incentivize
community shared solar, electrification,

00:09:25.436 --> 00:09:28.981
green businesses, good jobs
and worker cooperatives.

00:09:29.398 --> 00:09:32.401
Because today we are
at an inflection point